<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 2.57 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur. [CORRECTED 07:54 GMT]</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 2.57 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur. [CORRECTED 07:54 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects figure in headline and first paragraph from 25.67 million)</p>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 2.57 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 60.32 million rand the previous day, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
